# drive.press with game.memory at 64 (docs/port/MEMORY.md 6): the window and osMemSize are 64 MiB, the heap runs to
# 0x84000000 (the exit line, tools/port/heap_check.py), and the race is drive's: the same trace (synth_memory_same).
# until: 0x400000:900
# seconds: 90
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 0, track 0
# args: --set game.memory=64 --screenshot-at 1600 --screenshot mem64.png
# check: tools/port/heap_check.py mem64.log --memory 64 --short 0
# check: tools/port/synth_shot.py mem64.png 1
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
17 A           # the mode screen: a single race
20 A           # the track select: track 0
23 A           # the car select; the race starts at about 23.6 s and its countdown runs 3.5 s
27 A 20        # gas for 20 s
32 STICKRIGHT 1.5
36 STICKLEFT 1.5
47 B 3         # the brake
